        {
          "id": "p1-b5",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Dear colleague, I am referring Bex Samplewick (DOB\n1978-04-12) for evaluation of intermittent palpitations\nfirst noted on 2026-02-10. Episodes last under a minute\nand resolve at rest. There is no syncope or chest pain.",
